@startuml 09-implementation-roadmap
!theme plain
title Implementation Roadmap for finalizeOrder() Problem Resolution

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

|#E8F5E9|Short-Term (Sprint 23-24)|
start
:Document current behavior
in detail (this analysis);

:Add comprehensive logging
at all finalizeOrder() call points;

:Create integration tests for
all order creation scenarios:
- Standard checkout
- Stripe Checkout return
- Stripe Payment Element
- Webhook-first scenario;

:Review and update
Stripe\Model\Order overrides;

|#E3F2FD|Medium-Term (Sprint 25-27)|
:Create SessionStateManager service
to centralize session management;

:Create ContractOrderCreationService
as wrapper around OxidShopOrderService;

:Implement pre/post hooks
for finalizeOrder() calls;

:Add idempotency via contract ID
instead of sess_challenge;

:Improve error handling with
specific error codes;

|#FFF3E0|Medium-Term (Sprint 28-30)|
:Handle webhook-first scenario:
- Webhook marks contract as "payment_confirmed"
- User return checks flag
- Background job for abandoned returns;

:Add contract state machine
visualization to admin;

:Create order recovery mechanism
for failed finalizeOrder() calls;

:Performance optimization:
- Reduce database queries
- Cache contract lookups;

|#FCE4EC|Long-Term (Future)|
:Evaluate OXID core contribution:
- Event-based finalizeOrder()
- Would benefit all modules;

:Consider full contract-based
order creation (bypass finalizeOrder());

:Multi-payment support
(partial payments, subscriptions);

stop

legend right
    **Key Milestones**

    Sprint 23: Documentation & Testing
